        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgīsha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Paulo ntūng'wa wa ng'wa Kilisito Yesu, kūlwa shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu mpīja wise, na Kilisito Yesu ūyo alī kwisagīlwa kwise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlī Timotheo ng'wana wane gete ū mu kūzunya; shigongo na wiza na mhola shibize hamò nang'ho, kūfuma kūlī Mulungu Sīswe na Kilisito Yesu Seeba wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji kūlwa malange mabi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalaga mo ū mu Efeso gīt'ūmo nakakūkomelegeja aho najaga Makedonia, nguno balīmo bangī balīyūlanga malange gatatūngīlīgije; ūbahūgūla booye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī batizimanīlīja kwikala būponya makanza gabo bakūdegelekaga ngano, nūūlū mahoya ga mihayo ītī na būkalīkīle ya makwihela ga shibyalīlwe. Ū mihayo yenīyo ītagunanhaga nūūlū hado ū mu kūntūmamīla Mulungu mu kūzunya, ūlū ītī kwenheleja halalī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nguno ya kūkwinha ū būhūgūji wenūbū īlī gīkī, būbize ho būtogwa ūbo būfumile mung'holò neela na wiyangūji wawiza, na kūzunya kwa ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò na bamò bakwījimīījaga pyī ī yose īyī bayūgalūkīla mahoya ayo gatī na solobo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batogilwe kūbiza balangi ba shilagīlo, alīyo batīmanile nūūlū hado īyo bakīhayaga, nūūlū īkī bakigambīlaga kūlomeela na būgimu būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmanile gīkī ī shilagīlo shilī shawiza kūlī munhū ose ose ūyo wizunīlīja nasho ūmo shihayīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike īlī yawiza kwitegeleja gīkī, ī shilagīlo shitatūūlilwe kūlwa nguno ya ntūngīlīja, shilīho kūlwa nguno ya bashitiigwa na a babo balemile kūhang'wa; kūlwa basoso, bakenaagūji, banhū ba malofu na badalahi; na kūlwa babūlagi ba basaabo na baninaabo, hamò na babūlagi ba banhū bose bose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shilīho kūlwa nguno ya bajingi, na bagosha abo bakiyītīlaga ya minala na bagosha bichabo; na kūlwa babisi ba banhū na balomolomo, pye na a babo batashikīlījaga būlagane wabo. Shitūūlilwe kūlwa mihayo yose īyo īkachaamaga malange masoga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayo gizunīlīgije nī Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Mulungu nkumīlījiwa; ījo waninha nene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlūmbi kūlwa kūchīlwa shigongo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūnūmbaga no ū nguzuhya wane ū Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito; nguno akanibona nigeleelilwe, ūnitūūla ū mu nīmo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ī kwandya naalī nsosohaja wa lina lya ng'wa Mulungu, hangī naalī nuhya wa banhū, na ng'wibonya! Alīyo nakachīlwa shigongo nguno pyī ī yenīyo nayītaga mu būchilū chilū, kūlwa būtūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mulī Kilisito Yesu nitīīlwa shigongo shingī, na kūzunya, hamò na būtogwa kūfuma kūlī Seeba wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyū gūtūngīlīgije gete, hangī gwigeleelilwe kūzunyiwa na banhū bose; gīkī: Ū Kilisito Yesu akiza ū mu sī kūpīja ba shibi. Ū mu benabo, ū nene nalī wa kwandya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī nguno īyo īkenheleja nachīlwe shigongo yalī gīkī, ū mulī nene ūyo naalī nkenaagūji ntaale, ū Yesu Kilisito abooleche pyī ū wiyūmīlīja bokwe. Būbize ho būlolelo kū bose abo batogilwe kūnzunya we, na kwingīla mu būpanga bo welelo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ī haha akumīlījiwe na kūgongoolwa ū Ntemi wa welelo bose, ūyo atī wa kūyagala, nūūlū kūbonwa, ū ng'wene h'ūyo alī Mulungu ūmò wike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe Timotheo ng'wana wane, ī mihayo yenīyī nalīkūlagīla gīt'ūmo būhangi būkafunyiwa kūlwa nguno yako, gīkī ūdūle kwilwisha mu kalwīle kawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbize na kūzunya, na wiyangūji wawiza ū mu moyo; nguno ī haha balīho bangī balī mu nhabaala ya kūtubīla, kūlwa kūleka kūkūdīlīla ū kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo bamò, gītī ba Humaneyo na Isikanda, naanekelile Shetani balangwe, booye ū kwikala būsosohaja lina lya ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
